{% comment %}
  Testimonials section for homepage.
    Shows customer quotes in a responsive multicolumn layout with GSAP animations.
    {% endcomment %}
    
    <section class="py-24 bg-cream overflow-hidden testimonials-section">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
          <div class="text-center mb-12">
                <p class="text-gold text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.32em] uppercase mb-3">Testimonials</p>
                      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold text-dark tracking-tight">Real People. Real Results.</h2>
                          </div>
                          
                              <div class="testimonials-grid-wrapper overflow-hidden">
                                    <div class="testimonials-grid">
                                    
                                            <article class="testimonial-card" data-gsap="fade-up" data-delay="0.1">
                                                      <p class="testimonial-quote">“The Pre Menopause Support has been life-changing. Two months in and my mood swings have eased, my sleep is better, and I feel like myself again.”</p>
                                                                <p class="testimonial-author">— Priya S., 47, Delhi</p>
                                                                        </article>
                                                                        
                                                                                <article class="testimonial-card" data-gsap="fade-up" data-delay="0.2">
                                                                                          <p class="testimonial-quote">“I started taking Ashwagandha KSM/66 for work stress and the difference has been remarkable. I sleep deeper, feel calmer, and my energy is back.”</p>
                                                                                                    <p class="testimonial-author">— Rahul M., 35, Mumbai</p>
                                                                                                            </article>
                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                    <article class="testimonial-card" data-gsap="fade-up" data-delay="0.3">
                                                                                                                              <p class="testimonial-quote">“Shilajit Resin from eklyfe is the real thing. My stamina and mental sharpness have noticeably improved in just 6 weeks.”</p>
                                                                                                                                        <p class="testimonial-author">— Vikram T., 42, Pune</p>
                                                                                                                                                </article>
                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                        <article class="testimonial-card" data-gsap="fade-up" data-delay="0.4">
                                                                                                                                                                  <p class="testimonial-quote">“T Boost actually works — naturally. My gym recovery is faster, my focus is sharper. No gimmicks, just clean ingredients.”</p>
                                                                                                                                                                            <p class="testimonial-author">— Arjun K., 31, Bangalore</p>
                                                                                                                                                                                    </article>
                                                                                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                                                            <article class="testimonial-card" data-gsap="fade-up" data-delay="0.5">
                                                                                                                                                                                                      <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/100x100?text=Amit+Kumar+Verma" alt="Amit Kumar Verma" class="testimonial-image">
                                                                                                                                                                                                                <p class="testimonial-quote">"I am Amit Kumar Verma, a certified Yoga Teacher from Bihar School of Yoga with 9 years of experience in Yoga, Pranayama, Meditation, and holistic wellness. I personally used the Ashwagandha KSM and Shatavari from Eklyfe and had a very satisfying experience. I found them helpful for maintaining energy, balance, and overall wellbeing in my daily routine. The quality and authenticity of the products truly impressed me. As someone deeply connected with natural health and mindful living, I genuinely appreciate products that support physical and mental wellness naturally. I would definitely recommend them to anyone looking to improve their lifestyle and overall health."</p>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                          <p class="testimonial-author">— Amit Kumar Verma, Certified Yoga Teacher</p>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  </article>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        </div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            </div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              </div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              </section>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/gsap.min.js"></script>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/ScrollTrigger.min.js"></script>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              <script>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      if (window.gsap && window.ScrollTrigger) {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    gsap.utils.toArray('[data-gsap="fade-up"]').forEach(function(card) {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              var delay = Number(card.getAttribute('data-delay')) || 0;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      gsap.fromTo(card, {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  opacity: 0,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            y: 40,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      scale: 0.98
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      }, {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  opacity: 1,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            y: 0,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      scale: 1,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                duration: 0.9,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          delay: delay,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    ease: 'power3.out',
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              scrollTrigger: {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            trigger: card,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        start: 'top 90%'
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      });
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    });

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          gsap.to('.testimonial-card', {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    scrollTrigger: {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                trigger: '.testimonials-grid-wrapper',
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          start: 'top 100%',
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    end: 'bottom top',
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              scrub: true
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    },
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            y: -20,
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    ease: 'none'
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          });
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                });
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                </script>

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                <style>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  .bg-cream { background: #f9f5ee; }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    .text-gold { color: #c9a84c; }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      .text-dark { color: #111827; }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        .bg-dark { background: #111827; }

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          .testimonials-grid-wrapper {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                overflow-x: auto;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          }

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            .testimonials-grid {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  display: grid;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      grid-template-columns: repeat(1, minmax(0, 1fr));
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          gap: 1.5rem;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            }

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              .testimonial-card {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    scroll-snap-align: start;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        min-width: 320px;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            padding: 2rem;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                border-radius: 2rem;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        border: 1px solid rgba(17,24,39,0.06);
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(17,24,39,0.08);
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                transition: transform 0.4s ease, box-shadow 0.4s ease;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              }

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                .testimonial-card:hover {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      transform: translateY(-6px);
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(17,24,39,0.12);
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                }

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  .testimonial-quote {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        font-size: 1rem;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            line-height: 1.85;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                color: #111827;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        font-weight: 300;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  }

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    .testimonial-author {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          margin: 0;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              font-size: 0.92rem;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  font-weight: 700;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      color: #0f172a;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    }

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      .testimonial-image {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            width: 80px;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                height: 80px;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    border-radius: 50%;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        border: 3px solid #c9a84c;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            object-fit: cover;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                margin-bottom: 1rem;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.3);
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      }

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        @media (min-width: 768px) {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              .testimonials-grid {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              }

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  .testimonial-card {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          min-width: auto;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        }

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          @media (min-width: 1024px) {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                .testimonials-grid {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          }

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            .testimonials-section {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  position: relative;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            }

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              .testimonials-section::before {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    content: '';
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        position: absolute;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            top: 0;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                left: 50%;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    width: 100vw;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        height: 100%;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            transform: translateX(-50%);
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                background: rgba(201,168,76,0.04);
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    pointer-events: none;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        z-index: 0;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              }

                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                .testimonials-section > .max-w-6xl {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      position: relative;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          })
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      })
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    })
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                })}